source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20415","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"喬木村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"602"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.8813018798828,35.50798034667969]}}],"display_comment_original":"喬木村周辺には、近世村の記憶として小川村、富田村、伊久間村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、伊久間原遺跡、知久氏館跡、阿島遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、小川村、富田村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["椋鳩十","高登渉","田中正明"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["阿島陣屋","阿島傘伝承館","阿島の大藤","氏乗の桜","ポピー園","禍誤除けの滝","喬木村立椋鳩十記念図書館","矢筈公園キャンプ場"],"specialties":["阿島傘","イチゴ"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["椋鳩十読書便覧 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-23783010","ふるさとの椋鳩十 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-93003900","椋鳩十著作年譜 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-23780598"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%96%AC%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11540488","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11672307","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6782270","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%A4%8B%E9%B3%A9%E5%8D%81&keyword=%E5%96%AC%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"喬木村","wikipedia_revision_id":"110131854","wikidata_qid":"Q1203939","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%96%AC%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%A4%8B%E9%B3%A9%E5%8D%81&keyword=%E5%96%AC%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%91","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}